  "notes": [
    "**Walk it.** This is the one chart where quarter-note walking lines fit: Bbm–Db–Eb is a minor-third then whole-step climb; chromatic approach notes into each bar.",
    "**Verse sits on Bbm** with F / Fm as the turnaround — the V–i pull is the whole tension.",
    "**Bridge climbs** Ebm → Fm → Gb → F: the Gb→F half-step is the release into the last chorus.",
    "The record is on a 5-string; low Eb and Db under the chorus if you have it."
